msgctxt "612"
msgid "Oh! Did you finally remember who I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "(Where did I meet her before?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Maybe someone like me shouldn't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Wow, what a coincidence seeing you here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Huh? You talking to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Of course! Don't you remember me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "(She knows me somehow. Where did I meet her?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "I don't believe we've met."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"Huh!? We've definitely met! I can't believe you don't\r\n"
"remember me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "...Was it at Shine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "What? No, not there! I'm shocked you don't remember me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "...Was it at Jewel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "What? No, not there! I'm shocked you don't remember me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"I remember you. You're Ayaka from the Love in Heart\r\n"
"massage parlor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "That's right! Oh, I'm so glad you remember who I am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid "Though I... don't believe I got your name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "Right, I guess I didn't give it to you. It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Kiryu-san! What a cute name. ⑮ Here all by yourself today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Would you mind if I sat with you for a bit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Go right ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Okay! Cheers!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "Cheers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "Say, this is the first time we get to properly chat! ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "That's right. Before, you were busy being my masseuse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "Actually, the name of my profession is \"massage therapist.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid "How's that different from \"masseuse\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid ""
"While both professions give massages to clients, my job at\r\n"
"the shop is to use both massage and aromatherapy to soothe\r\n"
"my clients' stress and worries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "I had to study pretty hard to get licensed for my job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid ""
"Sounds pretty tough. From how down you looked earlier,\r\n"
"you could probably use some of that therapy yourself, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "Huh? How'd you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid ""
"...Oh. I must've been talking to myself again. You heard\r\n"
"that, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid "God, I'm so embarrassed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid ""
"When I get lost in thought, sometimes I start mumbling\r\n"
"all the things I'm thinking about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid ""
"Aww, don't laugh at me! I know I might seem like the serious\r\n"
"type, but I was really thinking hard about this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1308"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. ⑮ You know, I got this feeling the first time we\r\n"
"met, but you're surprisingly easy to talk to, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1332"
msgid ""
"You're so mature, too! I've always wanted to sit down and\r\n"
"chat with you. I don't have a lot of mature, cool-headed\r\n"
"guys like you in my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1344"
msgid "Can I get your advice on something that's bothering me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid "You want my advice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid "Or do you have to leave soon...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "(She did look pretty bothered. What should I do?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid "Sorry, I don't have that much time right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid ""
"Oh, really...? I'm sorry. I just really wish we could\r\n"
"talk more..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
msgid ""
"(Seems like she's really worked up about this. I'm starting\r\n"
"to get a bit worried about her, myself.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid "(I'm curious, but I should go.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1452"
msgid "You got 100 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1536"
msgid "All right, then, let's hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1548"
msgid "Huh? Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "Yeah. I might not be able to help, but I'll try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1572"
msgid "Okay! ⑮ I knew you were a nice guy, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1584"
msgid "You think so? (What's this \"I knew\" business? Well, whatever.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1596"
msgid "Well, uh... So there's this guy I'm really into."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1608"
msgid "Problems with your love life, then? Go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I like him a lot, but I get this feeling that it's\r\n"
"just not going to work out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1656"
msgid "Well, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1668"
msgid ""
"He's one of my clients. To be honest, when I first met him,\r\n"
"I thought he was pretty scary..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1680"
msgid ""
"But after talking to him, I realized he was so kind and\r\n"
"mature and relaxed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692"
msgid "Sounds like a nice guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704"
msgid "Yeah! ⑮ He's such a sweet guy! ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1716"
msgid ""
"Glad to hear it. Just be careful, a lot of those \"sweet\r\n"
"guys\" can turn out to be playboys in disguise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1728"
msgid ""
"Oh... He did seem like he was used to being around women,\r\n"
"so maybe there's some truth to your words..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1740"
msgid "It's a possibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1752"
msgid "But no, I'm sure he's not that kind of guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1764"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, he gives me this honest, straightforward look...\r\n"
"It makes me believe that he's not the kind of guy who'd\r\n"
"purposefully hurt anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1788"
msgid "(Man, she's really into him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1800"
msgid "That... I don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1812"
msgid "You never asked?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1824"
msgid "No. I thought maybe I shouldn't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1836"
msgid "Why's that? You think he's involved in something shady?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1848"
msgid ""
"I mean, maybe. From what I saw on his back, he's got to\r\n"
"have a serious past..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1860"
msgid "(There's something on his back? A tattoo, maybe?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1872"
msgid ""
"I think he's got some demons he's struggling with...\r\n"
"Not to mention the burdens he's carrying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1884"
msgid "But that's the part about him that makes me swoon! ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1896"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1908"
msgid "Everything! ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1920"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1932"
msgid "Hey, don't just clam up, say something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1944"
msgid "Sorry. What was the thing that made you decide he's the one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1956"
msgid ""
"The one thing that made me decide? Hmm... Probably when I\r\n"
"thought about how strong he was. ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1968"
msgid ""
"He was so confident and sure of himself. I knew he'd protect\r\n"
"me, no matter what happened! ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1980"
msgid "(Strong physically and mentally, then...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1992"
msgid ""
"Oh, gosh, my heart's racing just talking about him! I'm\r\n"
"starting to feel that drink, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2004"
msgid "I'm gonna go to the bathroom real quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2076"
msgid "Sorry about that! ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2088"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2100"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, do you still have time? There's more I want\r\n"
"to ask you about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2112"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2124"
msgid "Sorry, but I've gotta head out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2136"
msgid "...Please, it's not going to take much longer. Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2148"
msgid "(I probably should hear her out till the end, but...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2160"
msgid "All right, then, let's hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2172"
msgid "Sure, I'll stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2184"
msgid "Thank you. ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2196"
msgid "Right now I'm not sure if I should tell him how I feel..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2208"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2220"
msgid "I'm afraid of what he might say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2232"
msgid ""
"Well, you're an attractive woman, Ayaka. Any guy would be\r\n"
"thrilled to hear you were interested in them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2244"
msgid "You really think so? Aww, thanks. ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2256"
msgid "But... there's something I still haven't told you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2268"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2280"
msgid "Umm, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2304"
msgid "I was born a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2316"
msgid "Huh? Wait, so you're transgender?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2328"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2352"
msgid "!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2376"
msgid "Ever since I was a kid, I felt like I was a girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2388"
msgid ""
"But my whole life, I had... boy parts. It was really\r\n"
"hard for me to live like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2400"
msgid ""
"Doctors sometimes call it \"gender identity disorder\".\r\n"
"Personally, I don't like the word \"disorder\" being used\r\n"
"to describe who I am..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2412"
msgid "I see. Is it the same thing as being gay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2424"
msgid ""
"It's different. Being gay means you're attracted to people\r\n"
"of the same sex. Being trans means your gender identity is\r\n"
"different than the sex you were assigned at birth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2436"
msgid ""
"Oh, I get it. You were born as a man on the outside, but\r\n"
"on the inside, you felt like you were a woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2448"
msgid ""
"That's right. I underwent gender reassignment surgery,\r\n"
"so now my physical appearance matches the gender I\r\n"
"identify as. I'm a woman, through and through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2460"
msgid "Even so... I'm terrified of telling him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2472"
msgid ""
"I'm scared he'll completely lose interest in me. There's no\r\n"
"way I can come out and tell him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2484"
msgid "It's funny. I'm so in love, but so scared of being in love."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2496"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2508"
msgid ""
"...I'm sorry. I'm sure this is really shocking to hear. It\r\n"
"must be difficult to come to terms with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2520"
msgid "To be completely honest, it is a bit difficult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2532"
msgid "No, not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2544"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2556"
msgid ""
"Love is about accepting one another for who you are. It's\r\n"
"not always easy to find someone who will, however."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2568"
msgid ""
"Everyone has obstacles they've got to deal with. Yours are\r\n"
"just a bit bigger than everyone else's, Ayaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2580"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2592"
msgid ""
"I can't tell you how he'll react, but know this: if it\r\n"
"doesn't go well, it's not your fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2604"
msgid ""
"It just means you weren't compatible, or it just wasn't\r\n"
"the right timing for either of you. That's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2616"
msgid ""
"Just keep on keeping on, and one day, you'll meet someone\r\n"
"who's right for you. I sincerely believe that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2628"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2640"
msgid "Thank you. I feel a lot better about this now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2652"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2664"
msgid "...Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2676"
msgid "...What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2688"
msgid "I'm going to tell Kentaro-san how I feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2700"
msgid "Wait, who's Kentaro-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2712"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry! That's the name of the guy. ⑮ Sorry, guess I\r\n"
"forgot to mention it earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2736"
msgid "!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2748"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for today. ⑮ Oh, right! Can I get your\r\n"
"cell phone number?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2760"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2820"
msgid "Aaand saved! ⑮ I'll text you what happens with Kentaro-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2832"
msgid ""
"And hey, if you're ever feeling exhausted, swing by the\r\n"
"massage parlor anytime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2904"
msgid ""
"How'd it go, Kiryu-san!? I didn't get to hear everything she\r\n"
"said. Who's this Kentaro-san she mentioned?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2916"
msgid "That's the guy she's crushing on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2928"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2940"
msgid ""
"Weren't you just going on about how she was into me or\r\n"
"something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2952"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2964"
msgid ""
"Man, my read was totally off. Looks like I've got a ways\r\n"
"to go before I'm a real host."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2976"
msgid "There was one other important detail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2988"
msgid "She's a trans woman who was born as a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3012"
msgid "!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3024"
msgid ""
"...Oh, come on, Kiryu-san! You don't have to make up\r\n"
"something like that to cover your ass. It's okay if you\r\n"
"got rejected!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3036"
msgid ""
"Besides, if I didn't pick up on something like that, I'd\r\n"
"really be a failure of a host!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3048"
msgid "Well, you sure are a failure, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3060"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3072"
msgid ""
"Y'know, though, if someone like her came up to me and said\r\n"
"she was interested, I'd definitely consider it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3084"
msgid "What a nice girl. Too bad for you, though, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3096"
msgid "(Yeah, it really is too bad...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3108"
msgid "Oh man, look at the time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3120"
msgid "I gotta get back to work! See ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3132"
msgid "Hey! Hold up!"
msgstr ""

